## Codex operating-profile verification harness (Lab 12)
# Per-run evidence ledgers and CI transcripts are generated, machine- and
# time-specific — keep them local. A hand-picked evidence snapshot is
# committed under results/evidence/ instead (negated below).
scripts/codex-profiles/results/*
!scripts/codex-profiles/results/.gitkeep
!scripts/codex-profiles/results/evidence/
!scripts/codex-profiles/results/evidence/**
